In Gel 7.1, the FTS feature is part of the standard library. Let me recall the syntax:

```sdl
using fts version '1.0';

type Article {
    ...
    index fts::index on (
        fts::with_options(
            fts::concat(
                fts::field(.title, weight := 1.0),
                fts::field(.summary, weight := 0.5),
                fts::field(.body, weight := 0.1)
            ),
            language := fts::Language.eng,
        )
    );
}
```

And the search:
```edgeql
with result := fts::search(Article, fts::query('search terms', language := fts::Language.eng))
select result {
    object := .object,
    score := .score,
};
```

