```
fts::with_options(text: str, NAMED ONLY language: anyenum, NAMED ONLY weight_category: optional fts::Weight = fts::Weight.A)
```

And the example:
```
index fts::index on ((
    fts::with_options(.name, language := fts::Language.eng, weight_category := fts::Weight.A),
    fts::with_options(.description, language := fts::Language.eng, weight_category := fts::Weight.B)
));
```

So the index `on` expression is a tuple of `fts::with_options(...)` calls. Good.

